---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Work With Me — ShadowTechLife" description="Reviews, integrations and honest teardowns for a prosumer smart-home audience that buys on reliability, not hype.">
  <section class="section" style="border-top:none;padding-top:60px">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-eyebrow">Work with me</div>
      <h2>Brands: I only cover gear I'd put in my own walls.</h2>
      <p class="sec-lede">Reviews, integrations and honest teardowns for an audience of prosumers who buy on reliability, not hype. If your product genuinely holds up locally, we'll get on well. If it's cloud-tethered and fragile, I'll say so — which is exactly why the audience trusts the ones I recommend.</p>

      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;margin-top:42px" class="grid-3">
        <div style="border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:24px 22px;background:var(--panel)">
          <div style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--fog);margin-bottom:12px">01</div>
          <h3 style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:18px;color:var(--white);margin-bottom:8px">Honest reviews</h3>
          <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--fog)">Full teardown of what works, what breaks, and what happens when the internet drops. Gifted units disclosed as gifted.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:24px 22px;background:var(--panel)">
          <div style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--fog);margin-bottom:12px">02</div>
          <h3 style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:18px;color:var(--white);margin-bottom:8px">Integration deep-dives</h3>
          <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--fog)">How your device actually behaves in Apple Home, Matter, Thread and Home Assistant — the real setup, not the press-release version.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:24px 22px;background:var(--panel)">
          <div style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--fog);margin-bottom:12px">03</div>
          <h3 style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:18px;color:var(--white);margin-bottom:8px">Multi-platform reach</h3>
          <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--fog)">Long-form on YouTube, cut down for Shorts, Reels, TikTok and Facebook. One collaboration, every surface.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top:44px;padding:32px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:var(--panel);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap">
        <div>
          <div style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:18px;color:var(--white);margin-bottom:6px">Press kit and audience stats on request.</div>
          <div style="font-size:14px;color:var(--fog)">Get in touch and I'll send current numbers and rate options.</div>
        </div>
        <a href="mailto:shadowtechlife@houseofshadow.uk" class="btn btn-primary">shadowtechlife@houseofshadow.uk</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
